        "content": "TRACEABILITY_JSON={\"status\":\"READY\",\"unresolved\":[],\"undefined_symbols\":[],\"requirements_mapped\":[\"aprire esattamente quattro stazioni -> vincolo somma_i y_i = 4\",\"assegnare ogni zona a una stazione raggiungibile -> vincoli somma_{i in R_j} x_{ji} = 1\",\"domanda consuma capacità -> vincoli somma_j d_j x_{ji} <= u_i y_i\",\"almeno una stazione Ovest e una Est -> vincoli di apertura sui gruppi W ed E\",\"backup per Z3, Z8 e Z11 -> somma_{i in R_j} y_i >= 2 per le zone critiche\",\"minimizzare costi fissi e tempi pesati per domanda -> funzione obiettivo\",\"assegnazione solo a stazioni aperte -> vincoli x_{ji} <= y_i\"]}\n\n## 1. Insiemi, parametri e variabili decisionali\n\n### Insiemi\n\n- Stazioni:\n  \\[\n  I=\\{A,B,C,D,E,F,G,H\\}.\n  \\]\n- Stazioni Ovest:\n  \\[\n  W=\\{A,B,C,D\\}.\n  \\]\n- Stazioni Est:\n  \\[\n  E=\\{E,F,G,H\\}.\n  \\]\n- Zone:\n  \\[\n  J=\\{Z1,Z2,\\ldots,Z12\\}.\n  \\]\n- Zone critiche:\n  \\[\n  J^C=\\{Z3,Z8,Z11\\}.\n  \\]\n- \\(R_j\\subseteq I\\): stazioni raggiungibili dalla zona \\(j\\), come indicate nella traccia.\n- Arco di assegnazione \\((j,i)\\) esistente soltanto se \\(i\\in R_j\\).\n\n### Parametri\n\nCosto fisso \\(f_i\\) e capacità \\(u_i\\):\n\n\\[\n\\begin{array}{c|rrrrrrrr}\ni&A&B&C&D&E&F&G&H\\\\ \\hline\nf_i&35&32&40&30&38&33&36&31\\\\\nu_i&42&44&46&40&45&43&44&42\n\\end{array}\n\\]\n\nDomanda \\(d_j\\):\n\n\\[\n\\begin{array}{c|rrrrrrrrrrrr}\nj&Z1&Z2&Z3&Z4&Z5&Z6&Z7&Z8&Z9&Z10&Z11&Z12\\\\ \\hline\nd_j&8&7&10&6&9&8&7&11&6&9&8&7\n\\end{array}\n\\]\n\nTempi \\(t_{ji}\\), definiti per \\(i\\in R_j\\):\n\n\\[\n\\begin{aligned}\nR_{Z1}&=\\{A:3,B:5\\},\\\\\nR_{Z2}&=\\{A:6,B:8,C:10\\},\\\\\nR_{Z3}&=\\{B:11,C:4,D:6\\},\\\\\nR_{Z4}&=\\{C:7,D:9\\},\\\\\nR_{Z5}&=\\{A:6,D:3,E:5\\},\\\\\nR_{Z6}&=\\{B:11,E:8,F:10\\},\\\\\nR_{Z7}&=\\{C:7,F:4,G:6,H:8\\},\\\\\nR_{Z8}&=\\{D:3,G:9,H:11\\},\\\\\nR_{Z9}&=\\{E:8,F:10,H:5\\},\\\\\nR_{Z10}&=\\{F:4,G:6,H:8\\},\\\\\nR_{Z11}&=\\{A:6,E:5,H:11\\},\\\\\nR_{Z12}&=\\{B:11,G:3,H:5\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\n\\]\n\n### Variabili decisionali\n\n- \\(y_i\\in\\{0,1\\}\\): vale 1 se la stazione \\(i\\) è aperta.\n- \\(x_{ji}\\in\\{0,1\\}\\), per \\(i\\in R_j\\): vale 1 se la zona \\(j\\) è assegnata alla stazione \\(i\\).\n\n## 2. Formulazione matematica completa\n\n### Funzione obiettivo\n\n\\[\n\\min \\quad\n\\sum_{i\\in I} f_i y_i\n+\n\\sum_{j\\in J}\\sum_{i\\in R_j} d_j t_{ji}x_{ji}.\n\\]\n\n### Apertura di esattamente quattro stazioni\n\n\\[\n\\sum_{i\\in I}y_i=4.\n\\]\n\n### Presenza nei gruppi Ovest ed Est\n\n\\[\n\\sum_{i\\in W}y_i\\geq 1,\n\\]\n\n\\[\n\\sum_{i\\in E}y_i\\geq 1.\n\\]\n\n### Assegnazione univoca di ogni zona\n\n\\[\n\\sum_{i\\in R_j}x_{ji}=1\n\\qquad \\forall j\\in J.\n\\]\n\n### Assegnazione soltanto a stazioni aperte\n\n\\[\nx_{ji}\\leq y_i\n\\qquad \\forall j\\in J,\\ \\forall i\\in R_j.\n\\]\n\n### Capacità delle stazioni\n\n\\[\n\\sum_{\\substack{j\\in J:\\\\i\\in R_j}}d_jx_{ji}\n\\leq u_i y_i\n\\qquad \\forall i\\in I.\n\\]\n\n### Backup per le zone critiche\n\n\\[\n\\sum_{i\\in R_j}y_i\\geq 2\n\\qquad \\forall j\\in J^C.\n\\]\n\n### Dominio\n\n\\[\ny_i\\in\\{0,1\\}\n\\qquad \\forall i\\in I,\n\\]\n\n\\[\nx_{ji}\\in\\{0,1\\}\n\\qquad \\forall j\\in J,\\ \\forall i\\in R_j.\n\\]\n\n## 3. Codice Python con Gurobi\n\n```python\nimport gurobipy as gp\nfrom gurobipy import GRB\nimport json\n\nstations = [\"A\", \"B\", \"C\", \"D\", \"E\", \"F\", \"G\", \"H\"]\nzones = [\"Z1\", \"Z2\", \"Z3\", \"Z4\", \"Z5\", \"Z6\",\n         \"Z7\", \"Z8\", \"Z9\", \"Z10\", \"Z11\", \"Z12\"]\n\nwest = [\"A\", \"B\", \"C\", \"D\"]\neast = [\"E\", \"F\", \"G\", \"H\"]\ncritical_zones = [\"Z3\", \"Z8\", \"Z11\"]\n\nfixed_cost = {\n    \"A\": 35, \"B\": 32, \"C\": 40, \"D\": 30,\n    \"E\": 38, \"F\": 33, \"G\": 36, \"H\": 31\n}\n\ncapacity = {\n    \"A\": 42, \"B\": 44, \"C\": 46, \"D\": 40,\n    \"E\": 45, \"F\": 43, \"G\": 44, \"H\": 42\n}\n\ndemand = {\n    \"Z1\": 8, \"Z2\": 7, \"Z3\": 10, \"Z4\": 6,\n    \"Z5\": 9, \"Z6\": 8, \"Z7\": 7, \"Z8\": 11,\n    \"Z9\": 6, \"Z10\": 9, \"Z11\": 8, \"Z12\": 7\n}\n\ntravel_time = {\n    \"Z1\":  {\"A\": 3,  \"B\": 5},\n    \"Z2\":  {\"A\": 6,  \"B\": 8,  \"C\": 10},\n    \"Z3\":  {\"B\": 11, \"C\": 4,  \"D\": 6},\n    \"Z4\":  {\"C\": 7,  \"D\": 9},\n    \"Z5\":  {\"A\": 6,  \"D\": 3,  \"E\": 5},\n    \"Z6\":  {\"B\": 11, \"E\": 8,  \"F\": 10},\n    \"Z7\":  {\"C\": 7,  \"F\": 4,  \"G\": 6, \"H\": 8},\n    \"Z8\":  {\"D\": 3,  \"G\": 9,  \"H\": 11},\n    \"Z9\":  {\"E\": 8,  \"F\": 10, \"H\": 5},\n    \"Z10\": {\"F\": 4,  \"G\": 6,  \"H\": 8},\n    \"Z11\": {\"A\": 6,  \"E\": 5,  \"H\": 11},\n    \"Z12\": {\"B\": 11, \"G\": 3,  \"H\": 5}\n}\n\nmodel = gp.Model(\"H08_rete_emergenza_backup\")\nmodel.Params.OutputFlag = 0\n\ny = {\n    i: model.addVar(vtype=GRB.BINARY, name=\"y_\" + i)\n    for i in stations\n}\n\nx = {\n    (j, i): model.addVar(vtype=GRB.BINARY, name=\"x_\" + j + \"_\" + i)\n    for j in zones\n    for i in travel_time[j]\n}\n\nmodel.setObjective(\n    gp.quicksum(fixed_cost[i] * y[i] for i in stations)\n    + gp.quicksum(\n        demand[j] * travel_time[j][i] * x[j, i]\n        for j in zones\n        for i in travel_time[j]\n    ),\n    GRB.MINIMIZE\n)\n\nmodel.addConstr(\n    gp.quicksum(y[i] for i in stations) == 4,\n    name=\"exactly_four_stations\"\n)\n\nmodel.addConstr(\n    gp.quicksum(y[i] for i in west) >= 1,\n    name=\"at_least_one_west\"\n)\n\nmodel.addConstr(\n    gp.quicksum(y[i] for i in east) >= 1,\n    name=\"at_least_one_east\"\n)\n\nfor j in zones:\n    model.addConstr(\n        gp.quicksum(x[j, i] for i in travel_time[j]) == 1,\n        name=\"assign_\" + j\n    )\n\nfor j in zones:\n    for i in travel_time[j]:\n        model.addConstr(\n            x[j, i] <= y[i],\n            name=\"activation_\" + j + \"_\" + i\n        )\n\nfor i in stations:\n    model.addConstr(\n        gp.quicksum(\n            demand[j] * x[j, i]\n            for j in zones\n            if i in travel_time[j]\n        ) <= capacity[i] * y[i],\n        name=\"capacity_\" + i\n    )\n\nfor j in critical_zones:\n    model.addConstr(\n        gp.quicksum(y[i] for i in travel_time[j]) >= 2,\n        name=\"backup_\" + j\n    )\n\nmodel.optimize()\n\nstatus_names = {\n    GRB.OPTIMAL: \"OPTIMAL\",\n    GRB.INFEASIBLE: \"INFEASIBLE\",\n    GRB.INF_OR_UNBD: \"INF_OR_UNBD\",\n    GRB.UNBOUNDED: \"UNBOUNDED\",\n    GRB.TIME_LIMIT: \"TIME_LIMIT\",\n    GRB.INTERRUPTED: \"INTERRUPTED\",\n    GRB.SUBOPTIMAL: \"SUBOPTIMAL\",\n    GRB.NUMERIC: \"NUMERIC\"\n}\n\nsolver_status = status_names.get(model.Status, \"STATUS_\" + str(model.Status))\n\nif model.Status == GRB.OPTIMAL:\n    decision_variables = (\n        [y[i] for i in stations]\n        + [x[j, i] for j in zones for i in travel_time[j]]\n    )\n    variable_values = {\n        var.VarName: float(round(var.X))\n        for var in decision_variables\n    }\n    result = {\n        \"status\": solver_status,\n        \"objective\": float(round(model.ObjVal, 10)),\n        \"variables\": variable_values\n    }\nelse:\n    result = {\n        \"status\": solver_status,\n        \"objective\": None,\n        \"variables\": {}\n    }\n\nprint(\"SOLUTION_JSON=\" + json.dumps(result, separators=(\",\", \":\")))\n```\n\n## 4. Sintesi della soluzione\n\nLo stato è **OPTIMAL** e il valore ottimo è:\n\n\\[\nz^*=697,\n\\]\n\ncomposto da costo fisso \\(128\\) e costo di assegnazione \\(569\\).\n\nStazioni aperte:\n\n\\[\ny_A=y_B=y_D=y_H=1.\n\\]\n\nAssegnazioni non nulle:\n\n\\[\n\\begin{aligned}\n&x_{Z1,A}=1,\\quad x_{Z2,A}=1,\\quad x_{Z3,D}=1,\\quad x_{Z4,D}=1,\\\\\n&x_{Z5,D}=1,\\quad x_{Z6,B}=1,\\quad x_{Z7,H}=1,\\quad x_{Z8,D}=1,\\\\\n&x_{Z9,H}=1,\\quad x_{Z10,H}=1,\\quad x_{Z11,A}=1,\\quad x_{Z12,H}=1.\n\\end{aligned}\n\\]\n\nI carichi risultanti sono \\(23\\) per A, \\(8\\) per B, \\(36\\) per D e \\(29\\) per H, tutti entro le rispettive capacità.",
